sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Farmer as Farmer User
    participant Frontend as React Client (Vite)
    participant AuthContext as React Auth Context
    participant Express as Express API Server
    participant Prisma as Prisma ORM
    participant Database as PostgreSQL (Supabase)
    participant AIService as FastAPI AI Service
    participant OpenMeteo as Open-Meteo Weather API

    %% Farm Dashboard Interaction
    Farmer->>Frontend: Accesses Farmer Dashboard
    Frontend->>AuthContext: Verify JWT session in state
    Frontend->>Express: GET /api/v1/farms/dashboard (Bearer Token)
    Express->>Prisma: Fetch User Farms, Crops, Expenses, Orders
    Prisma->>Database: SQL SELECT queries with User ID filter
    Database-->>Prisma: User entities returned
    Prisma-->>Express: Farm dataset
    Express-->>Frontend: 200 OK JSON (farms, stats, activities)
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Render Dashboard Cards & Metric Overview

    %% Crop Recommendation Request
    Farmer->>Frontend: Enters Soil & Climate Values (N, P, K, pH, etc.)
    Farmer->>Frontend: Clicks "Generate Crop Recommendation"
    Frontend->>Express: POST /api/v1/ai/recommend-crop (Soil payload)
    Express->>AIService: POST /api/v1/recommend-crop (x-api-key)
    AIService->>AIService: Load crop_rf_model.joblib & run predict_proba()
    AIService-->>Express: 200 OK JSON (Top 3 crops with confidence & season)
    Express->>Prisma: Save to CropRecommendation & PredictionRecord
    Prisma->>Database: SQL INSERT
    Database-->>Prisma: Record saved
    Express-->>Frontend: 200 OK JSON (Recommendations)
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Displays Top Recommended Crops & Agronomic Advice

    %% Weather & Spraying Forecast
    Farmer->>Frontend: Views Weather & Spray Safety Window
    Frontend->>Express: GET /api/v1/weather/forecast?district=Pune
    Express->>OpenMeteo: GET /v1/forecast (lat, lon, current, daily)
    OpenMeteo-->>Express: 200 OK JSON (Hourly & Daily Atmospheric Metrics)
    Express->>Express: Calculate FAO-56 Penman-Monteith ET₀ & Spraying Window
    Express->>Prisma: Persist WeatherObservation record
    Prisma->>Database: SQL INSERT
    Express-->>Frontend: 200 OK JSON (Forecast, Spray Window, Risks)
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Renders Interactive 7-Day Weather Timeline & Advisory
